<title>USA: Champion Enterprises expands board.</title>
<headline>Champion Enterprises expands board.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Champion Enterprises Inc said it named Frank Feraco and Robert Stark to its board following the resignation of director Thomas Sturgess, who left for personal reasons.</p>
<p>It said the actions increase the size of the board to eight.</p>
<p>Feraco is president of Kohler Co's worldwide plumbing operations and Stark is a retired Hallmark Cards Inc executive.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
